#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "Umcebisi woHlaziya i-Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "Phucula i-Syslog ukusuka ku-%s ukuya ku-%s? Imiyalezo nemithetho esele ikhona iya kugcinwa. Utshintsho lwe-schema lunokuthatha ixesha."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Loluphi uhlobo lokuhlaziya/lokufakela ofuna ukulusebenzisa"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Xa uneetapile ezinkulu kakhulu, ukwenza i-Truncate kuya kukhawuleza kakhulu. Hayi, xa uneetheyibhile ezinkulu kakhulu, ukwenza i-Truncate kuya kukhawuleza kakhulu. Ukuba unexhala ngedatha yogcino, unokukhetha i-Inline, eya kumisa isikhangeli sakho ngexesha lolu phuculo, okanye imvelaphi, eya kudala inkqubo yemvelaphi ukuzisa idatha yakho endala ye-Syslog kwitheyibhile ye-backup ukuya kwifomathi entsha ye-Syslog. Kwakhona le nkqubo inokuthatha iiyure ezininzi. I-Truncate ilahla i-Syslog egciniweyo kunye nemiyalezo esusiweyo kuphela; imigaqo yesilumkiso, yokususa kunye neyengxelo ihlala igcinwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Susa okuqukethwe kwiTheyibhile ye-Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Uhlaziyo lwangaphakathi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Uhlaziyo olungasemva"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Injini yoGcino lweDathabheyisi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Injini yokugcina yeetafile zokuhlalutya. Kuphela ziinjini zokugcina ze-InnoDB kunye, kwi-MariaDB, i-Aria ezixhaswayo. Naluphi na ukhetho lwe-Remote Data Collector lufuna i-InnoDB; iindibaniselwano ezingahambelaniyo azinakuthunyelwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "Ugcino lwe-InnoDB"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Ugcino lwe-Aria"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Ukuchaneka kweTimestamp"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Ukuchaneka kwe-millisecond kugcina izitampu zexesha ze-syslog ezingaphantsi komzuzwana kwikholamu ye-TIMESTAMP(3) kwaye kufumaneka kuphela kwi-MariaDB. Ukuchaneka komzuzwana kusebenzisa ikholamu eqhelekileyo ye-TIMESTAMP. Kwinkqubo esebenzayo, sebenzisa cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms ngexesha lolondolozo ukuguqula imiyalezo ekhoyo ngaphandle kokuyilahla."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "I-Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB kuphela)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Umzuzwana - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Ukulungiswa kweMiyalezo eKude"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Vula ukuCubungula iMyalezo yoMqokeleli weDatha oKude"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Ukuba abaQokeleli beDatha abaKude bakho baneziseko zabo zedatha ze-Syslog kwaye becubungula imiyalezo yabo ngokuzimeleyo, khetha le bhokisi yokukhangela. Ngokukhetha le Bhokisi yokukhangela, abaQokeleli beDatha abaKude bakho baya kufuna ukugcina eyabo ifayile engu-'config_local.php' ukuze bazise i-Syslog ukuba isebenzise isiseko sedatha esizimeleyo sokubonisa nokucubungula imiyalezo. Nceda usebenzise ifayile yetempleyiti engu-'config_local.php.dist' kule njongo. ISILUMKISO: Iitheyibhile ze-Syslog ziya kudalwa ngokuzenzekelayo ngokukhawuleza xa olu khetho luvulwa."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Ungqamaniso lweMigaqo yoMqokeleli weDatha oKude"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Ukuba abaQokeleli beDatha abaKude bakho baneziseko zabo zedatha ze-Syslog kwaye becubungula imiyalezo yabo ngokuzimeleyo, khetha le bhokisi yokukhangela ukuba unqwenela ukuba imigaqo yee-Alert, yoKususa kunye neyeNgxelo yeziseko zedatha eziPhambili ze-Cacti ithunyelwe kwiSixokelelwano se-Cacti esiKude."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Gcina iiRekhodi kuMqokeleli oKude"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Gcina imiyalezo eqhutyweyo kwitheyibhile ye-syslog yomqokeleli okude emva kokuba ihanjisiwe kuMqokeleli oPhambili. Xa icinyiwe, iirekhodi zigcinwa ekuhlaleni kuphela ngelixa uMqokeleli oPhambili engafumaneki kwaye zisuswe emva kokuqinisekiswa kokuhanjiswa kwakhona."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Umgaqo-nkqubo wokuGcina"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Khetha ukuba zingaphi iintsuku zamaxabiso e-Syslog ofuna ukuzigcina kwisiseko sedatha."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Inqanaba lokuPhathishina"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Ubungakanani bohlulo ngalunye lweetafile ze-syslog ne-syslog_removed. Imihla ngemihla iyacetyiswa. Iyure nganye ifuna ixesha lokugcinwa elinomda, kwaye ixesha lokugcinwa kunye nenqanaba lokwahlulahlula zizonke kufuneka zingene kumda wohlulo lweseva yedatha. Ukutshintsha inqanaba kamva, litshintshe kwiiSetingi uze uqhube i-cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Nyusa uguqulelo"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Faka"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Umcebisi we-Syslog %s"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "ISILUMKISO: Ukuphuculwa kwe-Syslog kuthatha ixesha elininzi!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Ukuphuculwa kwetheyibhile ye-syslog engu-'main' kunokuba yinkqubo ethatha ixesha elide kakhulu. Ngenxa yoko, kuyacetyiswa ukuba unciphise ubungakanani betheyibhile yakho ye-syslog phambi kokuphucula, okanye ukhethe ukhetho lwangasemva."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Ukuba ukhetha ukhetho lwangasemva, itheyibhile yakho endala ye-syslog iya kuthyiwa ngokutsha, kwaye itheyibhile entsha ye-syslog iya kudalwa. Emva koko, inkqubo yokuphucula iya kuqaliswa ngasemva. Kwakhona, le nkqubo yangasemva inokuthatha ixesha elide ukugqitywa. Nangona kunjalo, idatha yakho iya kugcinwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Nokuba yintoni oyikhethayo, yonke imigaqo ekhoyo yokususa neyesilumkiso iya kugcinwa ngexesha lenkqubo yokuphucula."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Cofa u-<b>'Hlaziya'</b> ukuze uqhubele phambili nohlaziyo, okanye u-<b>'Rhoxisa'</b> ukuze ubuyele kwimenyu yeePlagini."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Unokuseta kwakhona injini yokugcina yedathabheyisi yeetheyibhile zohlalutyo i-syslog kunye ne-syslog_remove. Kuxhaswa kuphela injini yokugcina ye-InnoDB kwaye, kwi-MariaDB, injini yokugcina ye-Aria. Ukuba usebenzisa i-MariaDB, sicebisa iNjini yokuGcina ye-Aria xa kungekho zikhetho zoMqokeleli weDatha okude ezivuliweyo; iikhetho zomqokeleli zifuna i-InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Uneendlela ezininzi onokukhetha kuzo xa ufaka i-Syslog. Eyokuqala buKwakhiwa beSiseko seDatha. Iitheyibhile ezahlulahlulweyo kuphela kwezakhiwo ezixhaswayo kuba zithintela ubukhulu beeteyibhile ekubeni bube bukhulu kakhulu ngaloo ndlela zicothise imibuzo. Iitheyibhile zemveli ezingahlulahlulwanga ziphelelwe lixesha kwaye azisanikwa kufakelo olutsha."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Unokukhetha kwakhona ukuchaneka kwexesha lesitampu. Ukuchaneka kwe-millisecond (TIMESTAMP(3)) kugcina ulandelelwano lwangaphantsi komzuzwana lwemiyalezo engenayo kwaye kufumaneka kuphela kwi-MariaDB; ukufakelwa kwe-MySQL kusebenzisa ukuchaneka komzuzwana. Oku akunakutshintshwa endaweni kamva ngaphandle kokutshabalalisa imiyalezo egciniweyo."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Ugcino lwe-Aria alufumaneki ngelixa naluphi na ukhetho loMqokeleli weDatha oKude luvuliwe. I-InnoDB ikhethiwe."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Unokukhetha kwakhona ubude bexesha lokugcina. Nceda ukhumbule ukuba ukuba uneehosti ezininzi ezilogayo kwi-Syslog, le theyibhile inokuba nkulu kakhulu."

