msgid "Syslog %s Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi ze-Syslog %s"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What uninstall method do you want to use?"
msgstr "Yeyiphi indlela yokukhupha ofuna ukuyisebenzisa?"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When uninstalling syslog, you can remove everything, or only components, just in case you plan on re-installing in the future."
msgstr "Xa ukhupha i-Syslog, ungasusa yonke into, okanye amacandelo kuphela, ukuba nje uceba ukuyifakela kwakhona kwixa elizayo."

