msgstr "Akukho"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Useto Ngokubanzi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "I-Syslog Ivuliwe"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Ukuba le bhokisi yokukhangela ikhethiwe, iirekhodi ziya kugqithiselwa ukusuka kwitheyibhile ye-Syslog Incoming ukuya kwitheyibhile ephambili ye-syslog kwaye ii-Alert neNgxelo ziya kuvulwa. Nceda ukhumbule ukuba ukuba isixokelelwano sicinyiwe, amangenelo elogu aya kuqhubeka eqokelelana kwitheyibhile ye-Syslog Incoming njengoko oku kuchazwa yinkqubo ye-rsyslog okanye ye-syslog-ng."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "Dlulisela ii-alam kuMphathi wee-Alam"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Vumela imithetho emiselwe kwi-Alarm Manager ukuba idlulisele ii-alamu. I-imeyile ye-Syslog ihlala iyindlela yokugqibela; izenzo zemiyalelo zisebenza kuphela kwimithetho ye-Syslog Alarming."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Susa iiDomeyin"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Uluhlu olwahlulwe ngeekoma lweedomeyini ofuna ukuzisusa kwigama lehosti le-syslog, Imizekelo ingaba ngu-'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Ixesha loHlaziyo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Eli lixesha ngemizuzwana phambi kokuba iphepha lihlaziywe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Tsiba ukubalwa kwemiqolo iyonke"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Ukuba le bhokisi yokukhangela ikhethiwe, iithebhu ze-System Logs kunye ne-Alert Logs azibali irekhodi nganye ehambelanayo, nto leyo enokudla izibonelelo ezininzi kufakelo olukhulu. Iphepha libonisa amakhonkco athi Ngaphambili kunye nathi Landelayo endaweni yexabiso lilonke noluhlu lwamaphepha, kwaye u-Landelayo uyanikwa ngelixa iirekhodi ezininzi zisekhona."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Ubuninzi beeRekhodi zeNgxelo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Kwizilumkiso ezisekelwe kuMda, leliphina inani eliphezulu ofuna ukulibonisa kwingxelo.  Oku kusetyenziselwa ukunciphisa ubungakanani belogi ye-html kunye ne-I-imeyile."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "%d Iirekhodi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Ubuninzi beeNkqubo zokuPhatha i-Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Xa isetwe ngaphezu kwe-1, ukuqhutywa kwemiyalezo engenayo kusasazwa kwiinkqubo zabasebenzi ezihambelanayo. Umsebenzi ngamnye uphatha uluhlu olwahlukeneyo lwemiyalezo engenayo, okukhawulezisa ukusonjululwa kwegama lehosti kunye nokudluliselwa kwemiyalezo phantsi komthwalo onzima. Isetingi ye-1 iqhuba yonke imiyalezo kwinkqubo enye. Iinkqubo zabasebenzi azixhaswa kwi-Windows okanye xa izandiso ze-PHP pcntl ne-POSIX zingafumaneki, apho ukuqhutywa kubuyela kwinkqubo enye."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "%d Inkqubo Esebenzayo"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "%d Iinkqubo Ezisebenzayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Umyalelo wokuVula amaTikiti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Lo myalelo uza kwenziwa ukuvula Amatikiti eDesika yoNcedo. Umyalelo uza kufuneka ukuba uhlalutye iipharamitha ezininzi zegalelo ngolu hlobo lulandelayo: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. I-hostlist iza kuba luluhlu olwahlulwe ngekoma lweehosti ezichatshazelwe sisilumkiso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Iinketho zokuFumanisa iHosti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Vula ukuSombululwa kweGama leHosti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Ukuba le bhokisi yokukhangela ikhethiwe, onke amagama eehosti asonjululwa ngokukhangela kwe-DNS kuqala (ukuba kuvuliwe), kusetyenziswa iirekhodi ze-A kunye ne-AAAA. Iidilesi ze-IPv4 kunye ne-IPv6 azidingi kukhangelwa, kwaye iidilesi ze-IPv6 zigcinwa zicinezelwe ngoonobumba abancinci. Ukuba ukukhangela kwe-DNS kuyasilela, isixokelelwano siya kuzama ukusombulula igama lehosti ngokuchasene netheyibhile yeehosti ye-Cacti kwaye siyitshintshe ngenkcazo yehosti ye-Cacti. Ukuba kokubini ukukhangela kwe-DNS kunye ne-Cacti kuyasilela, iirekhodi zinikwa isimaphambili esithi 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Tsiba ukusonjululwa kwe-DNS kwiihosti ezingenayo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Ukuba le bhokisi yokukhangela ikhethiwe, isixokelelwano asiyi kuzama ukusombulula iihosti ngokukhangela kwe-DNS. Oku kuluncedo kwiindawo apho ukusombululwa kwe-DNS kungenakwenzeka okanye kungafuneki."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi zeSaziso ze-HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Vula i-imeyile eSekwe kwi-HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Ukuba le bhokisi yokukhangela ikhethiwe, zonke ii-imeyile ziya kuthunyelwa ngefomathi ye-HTML. Kungenjalo, ii-imeyile ziya kuthunyelwa ngombhalo nje."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Ifayile yeFomathi eza kuSetyenziswa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Khetha ifayile yokusonga ye-html elungiselelweyo kunye ne-CSS oza kuyisebenzisa.  Le fayile iqulethe zombini i-html ne-CSS zokusonga ingxelo yakho.  Ukuba iqulethe okungaphezulu kwe-CSS nje, kufuneka ubeke ithegi ekhethekileyo <REPORT> ngaphakathi kwefayile.  Le thegi yefomathi iya kuthatyathelwa indawo ngumxholo wengxelo.  Ezi fayile zikwifolda ethi 'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Ugcino lweDatha kunye noKwahlula"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Ukugcinwa kwe-Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Eli linani leentsuku zokugcina iziganeko."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Ubungakanani bohlulo ngalunye lweetafile ze-syslog ne-syslog_removed. Utshintsho lugcinwa apha kodwa lusebenza kuphela xa i-cli/upgrade_partitioning.php yakha kwakhona zombini ezi tafile; kude kube ngoko, ukugcinwa kohlulo kugcina ubungakanani obukhoyo. Ukwahlulahlula ngeyure kufuna ixesha lokugcinwa elinomda. Ixesha lokugcinwa, ifestile yokudala kwangaphambili kunye nenqanaba lokwahlulahlula zizonke kufuneka zingene kumda wohlulo lweseva yedatha, okanye iisetingi azigcinwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Ifestile yokuDala iiPhathishini Kwangaphambili"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Eli linani leentsuku zeepartition zexesha elizayo ekufuneka zigcinwe kwiitafile ze-Syslog ezahluliweyo, ukuze iipartition ezintsha zisoloko zahlulwa kwipartition ye-dMaxValue engenanto. Ukwahlulahlula ngeyure kusoloko kugcina ubuncinane iintsuku ezi-2."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "Usuku olu-%d"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "Iintsuku ezi-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Umda wokuBuyisela iPhathishini"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Xa izahlulo zingekho (umzekelo emva kokuphumla kolondolozo), ubuninzi bezi zahlulo zingekho ngetheyibhile nganye zenziwa kusetyenziso ngalunye lwe-Poller. Isikhewu esishiyekileyo siyaphila kwiindlela ezilandelayo; ukuthenwa kokugcina kuhlala kuhlehlisiwe de umda wesahlulo sexesha elizayo ubuyiselwe ngokupheleleyo. Isebenza kwiitheyibhile ze-Syslog ezahluliweyo kuphela."

