msgstr "Imiyalezo eyi-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Izivuso Zempilo Yomjelo Wokusebenza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Uluhlu Lwezaziso Zempilo Yomjelo Wokusebenza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Khetha uluhlu lwezaziso lwe-Thold olukhoyo ukwenzela izilumkiso zempilo yombhobho (pipeline). Abamkeli boluhlu abavuliweyo badityaniswa needilesi ze-imeyile ezingezantsi, kugcinwa abamkeli be-BCC. Izintlu zifuna itheyibhile yoluhlu lwezaziso lwe-Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Abamkeli be-I-imeyile Bempilo Yomjelo Wokusebenza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Abamkeli be-imeyile abahlulwe ngokhoma bokusilela kunye nokuchacha kwe-pipeline. Shiya kungenanto kwaye ungakhethi luhlu lwezaziso ukuze ucime i-imeyile; impilo ihlala ibonakala kwithebhu yoBume kwaye utshintsho lwemeko luyarekhodwa. Iitshekhi zifuna I-Poller ye-Cacti ukuba isebenze."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Ixesha Lesikhumbuzo Sempilo Yomjelo Wokusebenza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Phinda izaziso zeengxaki zombhobho eziqhubekayo emva kwesi sithuba. Imizamo ye-imeyile engaphumelelanga izanywa kwakhona kanye kuphela kwimizuzu emihlanu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Ukugcinwa kweZilumkiso ze-Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Eli linani leentsuku zokugcina iilogi zezaziso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Uthintelo lweSaziso noLondolozo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Iintsuku zeFestile yoLondolozo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Days when all alert notifications are muted during the configured maintenance timeframe."
msgstr "Iintsuku apho zonke izaziso zezilumkiso zithuliswayo ngexesha lolondolozo eliqwalaselweyo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Starts"
msgstr "Ukuqala kweFestile yoLondolozo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local start time for the global maintenance window."
msgstr "Ixesha lokuqala lendawo lefestile yolondolozo jikelele."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Ukuphela kweFestile yoLondolozo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Ixesha lokuphela lendawo lefestile yolondolozo jikelele. Ixesha lokuphela langaphambili liqhubela kusuku olulandelayo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Ulondolozo LweXesha Elinye Luyaqala"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Umhla nexesha lendawo elikhethwayo lokuqalisa ifestile yolondolozo jikelele yexesha elinye."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Ulondolozo LweXesha Elinye Luyaphela"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Umhla nexesha lendawo elikhethwayo lokuphelisa ifestile yolondolozo jikelele yexesha elinye. Ifomathi: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Ixesha lokuphola lesilumkiso elingagqibekanga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Cinezela nasiphi na isaziso esiphindwayo somgaqo omnye kunye nommandla wokunika ingxelo kule mizuzu mingaka. Amaxabiso omgaqo ngamnye ayayigqithisa le setingi. Seta ku-0 ukucima."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
msgstr "Ukucinezela okuphindaphindiweyo okungagqibekanga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress a notification with the same matched message set for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Cinezela isaziso esineseti enye yomyalezo ofanisiweyo kule mizuzu mingaka. Amaxabiso omgaqo ngamnye ayayigqithisa le setingi. Seta ku-0 ukucima."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Syslog Recovery"
msgstr "Ukubuyiselwa kwe-Syslog eKude"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Recovery Records Per Execution"
msgstr "Ubuninzi beeRekhodi zokuBuyisela ngokuSebenza ngakunye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of retained remote Syslog events sent to the Main Collector by one recovery worker execution. Each central database transaction remains capped at 100 records. Increase gradually while observing Main Collector load and lock waits."
msgstr "Elona nani liphezulu leziganeko ze-Syslog ezikude ezigciniweyo ezithunyelwa kuMqokeleli oyiNtloko ngumsebenzi omnye wokubuyisela. Ushintshiselwano ngalunye lwesiseko sedatha esiphakathi luhlala lulinganiselwe kwiirekhodi ezili-100. Yonyusa kancinci kancinci ngelixa ujonga umthwalo woMqokeleli oyiNtloko kunye nokulinda kokutshixa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Recovery Pause Between Batches"
msgstr "Ikhefu lokuBuyisela Phakathi kweeBhetshi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pause between each 100-record Main Collector delivery transaction. A longer pause lowers Main Collector pressure; a shorter pause speeds backlog convergence."
msgstr "Misa okwethutyana phakathi kwentengiselwano nganye yothumelo lweerekhodi ezili-100 yoMqokeleli oPhambili. Ukuma ixesha elide kwehlisa uxinzelelo kuMqokeleli oPhambili; ukuma ixesha elifutshane kukhawulezisa ukusombulula umsebenzi oshiyekileyo."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "No pause"
msgstr "Akukho kunqumama"

