#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The supplier of the device or software that logs this message, for example Cisco or Juniper."
msgstr "Umboneleli wesixhobo okanye isoftware ebhala lo myalezo, umzekelo i-Cisco okanye i-Juniper."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Vendor"
msgstr "Umthengisi"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "Isichongi"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message code to look for, for example %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN or 4625. It must equal a whole word of the syslog message (letters, digits and _ . - /); a leading % is literal and must match as written. The match is not case sensitive. See How Recommendations Are Matched on the list page."
msgstr "Ikhowudi yomyalezo ekufuneka ikhangelwe, umzekelo %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN okanye 4625. Kufuneka ilingane negama elipheleleyo lomyalezo we-Syslog (oonobumba, amanani kunye no-_ . - /); u-% okhokelayo ngokoqobo kwaye kufuneka ahambelane njengoko ebhaliwe. Ukuhambelana akukhathali ubukhulu boonobumba. Jonga Indlela eziHambelana ngayo iiNgcebiso kwiphepha loluhlu."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Component"
msgstr "Icandelo"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The facility, module or subsystem that raises the message."
msgstr "I-facility, imodyuli okanye inkqubo engaphantsi evelisa umyalezo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The severity the vendor documents for this message."
msgstr "Ubunzima obubhalwe ngumthengisi walo myalezo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message format as documented, including its variable placeholders."
msgstr "Ifomathi yomyalezo njengoko ibhaliwe, kubandakanywa nezibambi-ndawo zeziguquki zayo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
