msgstr "Amakhonkco aya kuxwebhu lomthengisi, elinye ngomgca."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [edit]"
msgstr "Isindululo [hlela]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [new]"
msgstr "Isindululo [esitsha]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A lightbulb before the message marks matching recommendations on the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs. Click the message to read them in the details flyout. Hovering never requests the server."
msgstr "Isibane esiphambi komyalezo siphawula iingcebiso ezingqinelanayo kwiithebhu ze-System Logs kunye ne-Alert Logs. Cofa kumyalezo ukuze uzifunde kwipaneli yeenkcukacha. Ukuhambisa imouse ngaphezulu akuzange kucele iseva."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Only the <b>Identifier</b> column is used for matching. The vendor, component, severity, message and explanation are shown in the details flyout but are never searched."
msgstr "Kukho umqolo we-<b>Isichongi</b> kuphela osetyenziselwa ukungqamanisa. Umthengisi, icandelo, ubuzaza, umyalezo kunye nengcaciso ziboniswa kwiphaneli yeenkcukacha kodwa azikhangelwa nakanye."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The first 2,048 characters of the message are split into words. A word is a run of letters, digits and the characters _ . - / that may start with %. Every other character, such as a space, colon, comma or bracket, ends a word. In <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> the words are <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> and <code>down</code>."
msgstr "Oonobumba bokuqala abayi-2,048 bomyalezo bohlulwa babe ngamagama. Igama luhlahlo loonobumba, amanani kunye neempawu _ . - / ezinokuqala ngo-%. Lonke olunye uphawu, olunjengesithuba, ikholoni, ikoma okanye isibiyeli, luphelisa igama. Kwi-<code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> amagama ngu-<code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> kunye no-<code>down</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "An identifier matches when it is <b>exactly equal to one whole word</b>, ignoring case. It is not a \"contains\", \"starts with\" or \"ends with\" search, and there are no wildcards: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> does not match the word <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, and <code>UPDOWN</code> does not match <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."
msgstr "Isichongi siyahambelana xa <b>silingana ncam negama elinye elipheleleyo</b>, singahoyi oonobumba abakhulu okanye abancinci. Ayilokhangelo lwe-\"iqulethe\", \"iqala nge-\" okanye \"iphela nge-\", kwaye akukho zi-wildcard: i-<code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> ayihambelani negama elithi <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, kwaye i-<code>UPDOWN</code> ayihambelani ne-<code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A leading <b>%</b> is literal, not a wildcard, and must match the message word as written. An identifier <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> matches the message word <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, not <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; an identifier without the prefix matches only the unprefixed word."
msgstr "U-<b>%</b> ophambili ngowokoqobo, ayingomsebenzi we-wildcard, kwaye kufuneka ungqinelane negama lomyalezo njengoko libhaliwe. Isazisi esithi <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> singqinelana negama lomyalezo elithi <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, hayi elithi <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; isazisi esingenasiqalo singqinelana negama elingenasiqalo kuphela."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "When the syslog host is a Cacti device whose vendor is recognised from its SNMP system description or device template, and recommendations exist for that vendor, only that vendor's recommendations and those without a vendor are checked. Otherwise all vendors are checked, but an identifier made only of digits matches only recommendations without a vendor. When several recommendations match, the longest identifiers are shown first, up to three."
msgstr "Xa ihosti ye-Syslog isisixhobo se-Cacti umthengisi waso uqatshelwe kwinkcazo yaso yenkqubo ye-SNMP okanye kwitempleyiti yesixhobo, kwaye kukho iingcebiso zaloo mthengisi, kuhlolwa iingcebiso zaloo mthengisi kunye nezo zingenamthengisi kuphela. Kungenjalo bonke abathengisi bayahlolwa, kodwa isichongi esenziwe ngamanani kuphela sihambelana neengcebiso ezingenamthengisi kuphela. Xa iingcebiso ezininzi zihambelana, ezona zichongi zide ziboniswa kuqala, ukuya kuthi ga kwezintathu."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifiers that contain other characters, such as the <code>#</code> slot placeholder or the <code>|</code> alternatives in some vendor documentation (for example <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), are kept and exported but can never match. Set <b>Can Match</b> to No to list them, and edit them into the exact code, for example <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."
msgstr "Izichongi eziqulethe ezinye iimpawu, ezinjengombambi-ndawo wesilothi oyi-<code>#</code> okanye ezinye iinketho eziyi-<code>|</code> kumaxwebhu athile omthengisi (umzekelo <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), ziyagcinwa kwaye zithunyelwe ngaphandle kodwa azinakuze zingqinelane. Cwangcisa u-<b>Ingangqinelana</b> abe ngu-Hayi ukuze uzidwelise, kwaye uzihlele zibe yikhowudi echanekileyo, umzekelo <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."

